# The Dead Letter Office's held-mail vault (CIPlay dead_letter_office_caves, 11-12 w12 prep; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe (11-14 dug): the knoll at -18 -22, the vault's mouth at -18 -37 (way in +z, 3 m level then 9 m),
# the chamber -25 -> -19, its hatch at -18 -22.5 and chest at -17.2 -21.2 (locked until Clerk Rouhi's talk, shown by her
# answer 2). Floor = the knoll's foot ~4 m (a guess). Rouhi at 55 -24.5. Offline-written, never run; re-read the offset after the build.
island The Dead Letter Office keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
empty
expect hidden dlvaulthatch
expect hidden dlvaultchest

# Rouhi first: the second answer shows the hatch
use Clerk Rouhi pick 2
expect message follow the HELD MAIL sign
expect shown dlvaulthatch

# In by the mouth, to the den
picture dl_vault_out -18 +3 -51 -18 +1.5 -37
walk -18 -45 to -18 -37 to -18 -31 to -18 -26 to -18 -23.5
picture dl_vault_in -18 5.9 -28 -18 4.7 -20 light=20

# The hatch opens on the held mail
use dlvaulthatch stay
expect message held mail
expect hidden dlvaulthatch
expect shown dlvaultchest
open Held mail
wait 2
expect item Placeable_PaperBundle 3

# And out again
walk -18 -23.5 to -18 -28 to -18 -34 to -18 -39 to -18 -46
